<<
/ActualText (Key Projects\nProject: Soul Hunter TTRPG \(Core Rulebook & Expansions\)\nInformation Architecture & UX Redesign: Led the complete visual and interactive system redesign for a flagship Chinese-fantasy TTRPG, focusing on the core character sheets.\nUsability & Iterative Design: Gathered user feedback from active playtest sessions to identify cognitive overload in the legacy layout. Redesigned information hierarchies for core sections \(Attributes, Skills, and Psionics\), optimizing whitespace and visual flow to significantly accelerate in-game data retrieval and character sheet updating.\nVisual Style Guide & Marketing Collateral: Developed the game\031s signature Chinese-fantasy art style guide, establishing custom typography, grid systems, and color palettes. Created full-suite marketing assets \(crowdfunding pages, banners, flyers\) that supported a campaign generating over \245800k in funding and million-level exposure.)
/K [20]
