/ActualText (Project: Undying \(Shipped\) | Premium Survival RPG with Resource Management\nCore System UX/UI Design & Usability Iteration: Served as the lead UX/UI designer, driving the interaction design for core systems including inventory management, character progression, and world map navigation. Iterated key interfaces based on playtest feedback and gameplay balance adjustments to reduce cognitive load.\nInformation Architecture & Flow Mapping: Analyzed complex design specifications to build intuitive user flows and information architectures, translating abstract game mechanics into clear, actionable layouts.\n0-to-1 Design System & Art Direction: Established the game's comprehensive UI style guide and design system from scratch, defining the visual identity, typography, iconography, and responsive grid layouts.\nFigma-to-Unity End-to-End Delivery: Created high-fidelity interactive prototypes in Figma and personally implemented the assets within Unity, ensuring pixel-perfect fidelity and smooth transition animations.)
/K [9]
/S /Span
/Type /StructElem
/P 1631 0 R
/Pg 1001 0 R
